  "solution": "Ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover><mi>g</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>g</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>245</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTheo đề ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>P</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>d</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>245</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>428</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>75</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.",
